## Proposed Changes

### Global Styling

#### [MODIFY] [index.css](file:///d:/OneWebPC/OneDrive/ERP%20for%20U/src/index.css)
- Define standard font-size variables in the `:root` pseudo-class (and the `[data-theme="dark"]` override if necessary).
- Introduce text utility classes (`.text-xs`, `.text-sm`, `.text-base`, `.text-md`, `.text-lg`, `.text-xl`, `.text-2xl`, `.text-3xl`).
- Refactor existing styling rules throughout `index.css` to replace hardcoded values (e.g. `0.85rem`, `1.25rem`) with CSS variable references.

